# Temporary Lockdown enters on turn 7 and exiles every nonland permanent of mana value 2 or less, whoever controls it:
# Bot1's Ornithopter (0) and Mesa Pegasus (2, exactly at the limit) and Bot2's Misshapen Fiend (2), and a 1-mana enchantment each (Sigarda's Aid, Scavenger's Talent): neither a creature nor an artifact. Spider-Man (3) and
# Hired Blade (3), just past the limit, stay, and so do the lands and the Lockdown itself (CR 610.3). On turn 9 Bot1
# disenchants the Lockdown and the three exiled cards come back at once, under their owners' control (CR 610.3).

